      "statusChangeNewStatus": "open",
      "value": "Let's swap this back to Open. That doesn't mean anything other than \"leaving stuff as planned for almost a year seems annoying\". It makes people think that we're working on it right now and it is on the way out soon. It isn't.\n...but we're still considering this and it is still a good idea. I just want Custom Statuses from Canny, thank you very much! 😡 Would love to set things as \"Under Consideration\" or \"Tracked Internally\". \nDefinitely want to add this in some way eventually. There's actually a few avatar release types I've thought up, just while I've been typing this.",
