      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Coming back to this again as I got to first hand witness users 'trading' favorited avatar cloning. Which means never having to go to an avatar world to get the avatar. Which is fine and all the reason to have it be a toggle the uploader can assign on upload. But it should be an option so that if a creator specifically only wants it to be obtainable from a world they should be able to like if they want the person to see credits information that was hosted in the world for example.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
