      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So seeing as vrc banned me for calling them out on this, this canny was first suggested in 2018. Just about 4 years ago. FOUR. And has just around 1K upvotes since then, with plenty of similar threads merged in, no doubt. As well as acknowledgement from VRC. Well where is the feature? Since you're so keen on reminding us while banning mods, that you try \"your best\" to implement requested features? Because even mods wouldn't fix this one. And it still has never been addressed. And there's plenty of requested qol features that need addressing and have similarly, a lot of attention, that take forever to be addressed, or never do, because I get it- vrc has different priorities internally- all the while, simple mods and tweaks that could address them right now, even if as stopgaps while vrc circles back around to them in their own time- are now tossed under the bus along with the skiddies and rippers, as if they were all the same thing.",
