      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How would this even work in practice?\n\n- Disallow changing into avatar from favorite avatars?\n\n- Disallow changing into avatar from VRChat Home website / API?\n\n- Disallow changing into avatar from OSC?\n\nRedeem a code from https://vrchat.com/home/redeem, piggybacking off the shop system for a free to claim avatar?\n\nI don't see it feasible to allow switching into an avatar only while in a specific world, e.g. because the user's launch world may not be the same world.\n\nThe ship may have sailed already for this feature request, with avatar search worlds and websites and public avatar IDs being logged in various places without relying on the cloning feature.",
